At Wed, 23 Nov 2005 10:22:49 +0530,
V Ganesh wrote:
> 
> What are your thoughts are on changing the default PCM device to the
> multichannel one, and inflicting DXS only on those who specifically ask
> for it? I know it can be done in .asoundrc, but IMHO it's better to do
> it in the package itself.

Well, I feel it's rather in contrast.  The majority requires the
hardware mixing, which is not possible with multi-channel DMA.

But, yes, it'd be nice to have an option to allow users the digital
out without SRC.

The question is "how".  Since the device for DXS and multi-channel
streams are different, we have to decide which one to use at the time
to open a PCM...


Takashi


